    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，一盏电灯的额定电功率是 100 瓦特，每天点燃 6",
        "小时. 试求这盏灯在一个月 (30 天) 内所消耗的电功."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
